   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Explain the process of BCD addition. Perform BCD addition for the numbers <strong data-end=\"280\" data-start=\"267\">59 and 73</strong> using binary-coded decimal. Show each step in detail, including necessary corrections, and provide the final answer in both BCD and decimal.</p>\n",
